msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫가녀린 목소리를 힙겹게 냈습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_150CD807_4299_47CA_B84C_6623A7E6D0C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a722a27a161ef610257c80cebdedd659d8c8f2d4e12e6fef8b029db72b9ac843
