msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150CD807_4299_47CA_B84C_6623A7E6D0C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared so fragile, so precarious looking down on him that it seemed as though, if a "
"gust of wind were to whisk through the room, it would blow her away completely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이 방에 바람이 불었다면 ⟪k:1⟫바람에 지워질 것처럼 덧없는 분위기를 띤 채, ⟪k:2⟫불안정한 눈이 "
"멜을 보았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_2AC24185_B847_4C08_854B_01126C59DF24
