msgctxt "scenario:scenario_81F6FC89_2B58_4C3C_BAE7_82FA74AF0CB3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, her hand did not pull away from his still-slender neck."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀의 손가락은 ⟪k:1⟫남성 치곤 ⟪k:2⟫아직 가느다란 멜의 목에서 ⟪k:3⟫떨어지려 하지 않았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_68EAF0F8_6B60_4A9A_A4EB_455D82824D79
