msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Her hand... ⟪k:1⟫is so cold.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(이 애의 손……, ⟪k:1⟫역시 ⟪k:2⟫차가워――)"

#: scenario:scenario_7E64D941_CE36_4FDD_BE44_6DA9F1407E3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
