msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He did not challenge her, but simply kept his eyes affixed on hers, as if carefully watching "
"to see what she would do next."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫멜은 그 행위를 말리지 않고 ⟪k:1⟫소녀의 눈을 ⟪k:2⟫가만히 응시했습니다. ⟪k:3⟫그건 마치 ⟪k:4⟫지"
"켜보는 것 같았지요."

#: scenario:scenario_9A1FA805_25C0_4FBE_B920_D55F4E79D37A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f04e7e1f4292918ab81ea9897633b867f880fa38304b373b6f9bb8940763ef9
