msgctxt "scenario:scenario_370DCC67_C39B_47A0_8F61_70DDD955AB8F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her long white hair and his soft flaxen hair touched; for just the briefest of moments, it "
"appeared in the darkness as though they had fused together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫긴 순백색 머리칼과 ⟪k:1⟫부드러운 아마빛 머리칼이 ⟪k:2⟫잠시 뒤엉키듯 ⟪k:3⟫닿았습니다. ⟪k:4⟫이 "
"둘은 ⟪k:5⟫어둠 속에서 하나가 된 것 같았습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_A021B417_9600_4A0D_8AD0_FD48109DB284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5278cc02427b04c8e3b7ae6ce410b7389f64236998fb6c067a525cccee48d52c
#. default-sha256: ca132a3d45eb2fe649b9a065249c3128ae53cb2c973e9a77b2ad0d2074f940d4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A021B417_9600_4A0D_8AD0_FD48109DB284"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl, having finally gathered the courage, began to slowly tell her tale."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫드디어 각오가 되었는지 ⟪k:2⟫띄엄띄엄 설명하기 시작했습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_7057D7E3_AA09_4B19_96B6_1163119CB401
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0c552297855d857b951c38451e6b75c62e001c00a9f331d229d811186e70f2a
