msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7057D7E3_AA09_4B19_96B6_1163119CB401"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On the night of the storm, I paid a visit to Rose Manor—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫this mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 폭풍이 불던 밤……, ⟪k:1⟫저는 ⟪k:2⟫장미 저택……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫이 저택에 왔어요."

#: scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43c052a5285e8f76f07062c0a9dcc9b44a94a5bbdc7d885f926dfc16d149f663
#. default-sha256: 121da46bc09eb288ac9da856d2c0a4602defe3ddaf1806d97050ceadb00470d9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father and I were always on the move, traveling across the land by foot, so it was only "
"recently that we heard rumors of Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫장미 저택 소문을 들은 건 ⟪k:1⟫최근 일이에요. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저희 부녀는 여러 지방을 ⟪k:4⟫전전했거"
"든요."

#: scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be0252a31e026f645a681b1d2aa093103ef243f875f80628099fbdc662d51145
#. default-sha256: 62caf4e8eff8a56dcb7ec6a36dacbd059485229faed7245522ff12bf0528e20f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There are several reasons we couldn’t stay in one place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First... ⟪k:3⟫is my "
"unusual appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이유는 여럿 있어요. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫먼저…… 제 외모가 ⟪k:3⟫특이한 점."

#: scenario:scenario_2C9D2B32_97EA_4808_BDDA_26140DDEC0AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4189587ec1af21139ffb3836161698e6dbe0b9bea048c2a7421828b324053f0
#. default-sha256: fb7b68903048ab210970ccca2756fa22dc8c07e6cd6f8c4883d1d9379fc147f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2C9D2B32_97EA_4808_BDDA_26140DDEC0AF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫People often find the color of my skin or eyes disconcerting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 흰 피부랑 ⟪k:1⟫눈 색깔은 ⟪k:2⟫쉬이 거부감을 샀어요."

#: scenario:scenario_0428C509_3AD5_41EF_A5FB_CC73F0B3390B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86d997b55d630c239b369d35e5273c1108c3f4bb52b6df8820fa95cffe25e017
#. default-sha256: 93bd43d7a7d3176ec1d8156ae05507df119d927bc9400bdd132dfb9982658307
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0428C509_3AD5_41EF_A5FB_CC73F0B3390B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So after living in one place for long enough,⟪k:1⟫unsettling rumors would begin to spread, "
"forcing us to leave."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래서…… 한 곳에 오래 머무르면 ⟪k:1⟫어느새 불온한 소문이 돌기 시작해서 ⟪k:2⟫떠날 수밖에 없어"
"졌죠……."

#: scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72e1ff0b83ae23e67fa3c4890cfbc79c8f7bf432033bda22e08c4b323a0b182b
#. default-sha256: e6ab42bdd68e6a44c4a3f6dec8eceb293c2e33e7d4e89f0cfc5a13251de99df7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Another reason... ⟪k:1⟫was my father’s line of work.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He painted pictures for a "
"living."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고…… 아버지 직업도 이유였어요. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫제 아버지는 화가였거든요."

#: scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e86cf7861c6ef6ea3730d048dace12e4fd1379ca8da41b91b27f6d4cb9a11e48
