msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had trouble finding a patron, so he had to work day-to-day...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When he was no "
"longer able to find work in a city, we would move."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 후원자도 좀처럼 안 생겨서 ⟪k:1⟫그날그날 벌어먹었고……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫한 곳에서 일거리를 구할 "
"수 없어지면 ⟪k:4⟫다른 곳으로."

#: scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac4cb222fc86cdba659183f9fa15f8bc13e3cb516a25178cb329d00a7a393e25
#. default-sha256: d65945e76017444d1a6112c699c5e3ba3e14eb3db3bf80998fd77117f26de5df
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were birds that migrated without a flock."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저희는 ⟪k:1⟫고독한 철새 같았어요."

#: scenario:scenario_4A09487B_5B8F_4949_B006_58FCF7D98D50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 240afad496c4705c93938038e33628e762e72b7fe6a2e6ba4b6bacb9c0efc17b
