msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Yes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was before I was born, so you probably don’t remember, Lord Mell."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……네. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫제가 태어나기 전 일이니 ⟪k:3⟫멜 님도 모르실 거예요."

