msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The rose you tried to give me is an example of that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was certainly crafted with "
"skill, but the jeweler is only known because some aristocrat spoke highly of him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신이 제게 주려 하신 장신구도 똑같아요. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫확실한 기술이 있어도 ⟪k:3⟫이름이 잘 나가"
"는 건 귀족이 싸고 돌아서죠."

#: scenario:scenario_6962A1BA_5A83_4624_A0CC_8C6E364D191B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc61bf803ff0ceaef1b6740032f4ccdf07eb56728bda05c02b0489f53351923f
