"⟪k:0⟫The Rhodes family stole everything from my father.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But even thrown out onto the "
"streets, his only skill was painting."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫로즈 가문은…… 아버지에게서 모든 걸 빼앗았어요. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그래도 아버지는 그림밖에 못 그렸죠."

#: scenario:scenario_571CF3A2_CEFA_4E6C_B91D_1E24807F6603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7d2a9d3c1a639021f4cb2ea88efcb2f6f2e66a6b07d7beb7512d5fc8e4e97a5
