msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아버지는 끝까지 ⟪k:1⟫저만 걱정하셨어요……."

#: scenario:scenario_CD6E291F_755C_4BE7_B15C_D83003B2EADE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
