"⟪k:0⟫He held me in his arms and ran his fingers through my hair,⟪k:1⟫an apologetic look on his "
"face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 몸을 끌어안고, ⟪k:1⟫제 머리를 쓰다듬은 후,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫미안한 표정을 지으셨죠……."

