msgid "⟪k:0⟫If I had a normal appearance...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m sure life would have been much easier."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 외모가 평범했다면…… ⟪k:1⟫더 편히 살 수 있었을 거라며……."

#: scenario:scenario_B8E1E342_BE88_4156_A690_13018EBCDAAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ef36a8ba8326c73c19ac3968e25691c2091e0a07660b312d67270945c83d982
