#: scenario:scenario_28853A73_29D4_4A43_BF93_9BA4F07EF93B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aec74b83b1d5dc5ddf0ed4c718eed5c0b7eebf132c8c45955b181be7e663fe19
