msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I had never met any of you before,⟪k:1⟫so she must simply be that kindhearted a woman."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫저는 여러분과 만난 적이 없으니 ⟪k:2⟫마님의 인품이 그러신 걸 거예요."

#: scenario:scenario_7A982247_1E84_4602_B391_86DD1D3DB012
