#: scenario:scenario_86496116_5CBB_4FAF_99B7_4A39E11F1AAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebf319c5a674f3b3aa353483b3390659fd8faea27591e927e70a98137461ce9c
