msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For several long moments, her lips trembled in trepidation. But in time, she squeezed them "
"together and made a smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 잠시 불안하게 입술을 파르르 떨었지만, ⟪k:1⟫그러다 ⟪k:2⟫입술을 꾹 깨물곤 ⟪k:3⟫미소를 지"
"었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_D3976FA8_1FF1_4B42_B2E7_ABCEB885D513
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
