#: scenario:scenario_B636FE98_E51B_4325_83D6_2944F597A7AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5721af1ae0574ca1431e31e795ff66fef3b67448719606dafd7628e90e7276b7
